
dock load
  load <global:response>, name response

load @term/seed/code/network/http
  find response

task read
  take response, like response
  take format, like text, fall text <text>

  fork case, read format
    case text
      send back
        call response/text
          read response/dock
    case bytes
      send back
        call response/bytes
          read response/dock
    case json
      send back
        call response/json
          read response/dock

